- "I myself realize from this post that I also do need to learn how to regulate my feelings better. My depression and lack of emotional intelligence left me feeling broken but I understand now its not the way to emotionally react to what was said." [ar037-0052]

**But:** He later accepts a different interpretation of what the child said: "He's still learning how to communicate his feelings. I was very caught off guard and never thought about how kids say stuff like that when they're young and don't know entirely what effect it has or what they're really trying to communicate." [ar037-0051]

